This licence covers the code in this repository (src/, scripts/, deploy/).

The constructed datasets in data/ are derived from third-party corpora and
inherit their terms: data/ctrlpairs_v2.jsonl and data/belief_items.jsonl derive
from NQ-Swap (MIT, via pminervini/NQ-Swap, itself derived from Natural
Questions), and data/ragtruth.jsonl derives from RAGTruth (MIT, via
wandb/RAGTruth-processed).

This work is "Built with Llama": Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct is used under the Llama
3.1 Community License. Gemma-2-9B-it is used under the Gemma Terms of Use.
Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct and Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 are Apache-2.0. The
DeBERTaV3 MNLI/FEVER/ANLI checkpoint is MIT. No model weights are redistributed
here.
